27
00:10:43,036 --> 00:11:12,263
And that change actually came from people coming to one of our public meetings in 2020 and asking about whether we could use our funding for trees. And Medford had never done it before. And we looked into it and we absolutely could. So we started doing that. And it was purely a question that came up. We hadn't actually even thought about whether this money could be used for that. So we're always open to ideas that are new.

